     1336        ub.c-gds-obj.fact-rubl AT ROW 18.63 COL 16.38 COLON-ALIGNED
     1337             LABEL "Сумма уч.цен" FORMAT "->>,>>>,>>>,>>>,>>9.99"
     1338              VIEW-AS TEXT
